&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the Chief of Staff to the EVP of Global Ad Sales, you will serve as a high-leverage strategic operator, executive proxy, and force multiplier across the Global Sales Organization (GSO). Your key function is to scale executive attention, accelerate decision velocity, and translate GSO’s highest strategic priorities into clear execution and follow-through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal Chief of Staff operates with high EQ to maintain Reddit’s open, collaborative, and accessible culture while ensuring that executive time is prioritized for high-impact drivers. You will partner closely with Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, regional sales leadership, and cross-functional executive teams to orchestrate a seamless operational rhythm and drive global alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is required to be based in New York or London.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drive Alignment &amp;amp; Prioritization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Filter &amp;amp; Route Inquiries:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear operational paths for routine data requests, incident reporting, and tactical items below the executive level, freeing leadership bandwidth for major revenue initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Proxy &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent the EVP in key cross-functional leadership forums, planning reviews, and offsites, building bottoms-up consensus and alignment before issues require top-down intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Surface Field Signals:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize customer sentiment, competitive dynamics, and field feedback directly from front-line sales teams to keep executive leadership deeply connected to market realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Frame Executive Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure material revenue proposals and strategic escalations reaching the EVP are pre-framed with clear context and explicit recommendations, allowing leadership to focus on high-order strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operational Rhythm &amp;amp; Business Cadence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Business Cadence: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain the global sales operational rhythm, including leadership reviews, quarterly business reviews, strategic offsites, and key team communication forums, ensuring priorities are proactively tracked and fire drills are minimized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment with Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner seamlessly with Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations by translating strategic outputs into operational workstreams, leadership narratives, and review frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communications &amp;amp; Collateral:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive end-to-end preparation of strategic collateral, executive presentations, board materials, and organizational communications in close coordination with Internal Comms partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Track Strategic Priorities &amp;amp; Follow-Through&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track &amp;amp; Report on Key Commercial Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Track high-priority commercial initiatives and global sales bets, ensuring every key initiative has a clearly defined owner, success metrics, and milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure regional and functional leaders leave executive reviews with clear action items and deadlines; track ongoing performance against overarching organization priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Initiative Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment and operational support for complex, multi-functional sales initiatives across GTM, Product, Marketing, and SS&amp;amp;O.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience in a Sales/revenue/business strategy &amp;amp; operations role within an ad sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the rhythm of the business in a high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills, with a proven ability to synthesize complex data/insights and build actionable strategies around the highest impact opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication and relationship building skills, with the ability to build trust and influence across all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented and committed to driving measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative operator, accustomed to leveraging technology (i.e. AI, tooling), to scale, improve and help the team operate more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ideal Candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Believes in Reddit’s mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is organized and can build their own structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a strong communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is an optimist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is humble&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can effectively communicate with everyone from engineers to sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is fact-based, and willing to be hypothesis-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Needs limited guidance and no instruction manual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a force multiplier vs. a barrier to their executive partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Planning Support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Personal Pension Scheme with Employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical and Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3754 - Senior Associate, Search - Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Search Executive, you will manage the delivery and optimisation of paid search activity across your clients. You will build strong technical foundations, develop confidence across platforms, and understand how paid search contributes to broader client and business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Senior Executives, Managers, and Directors, you will own defined areas of campaign execution, reporting, and analysis, developing the skills and confidence required to progress into more autonomous roles over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the WPP Media you’ll be encouraged to continuously learn, ask questions, and build craft excellence in a supportive team environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Support &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the setup, optimisation, and maintenance of paid search campaigns across platforms such as Google Ads and Microsoft Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with keyword research, creative, bid adjustments, and budget pacing and optimisation under guidance from senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out quality assurance (QA) checks to ensure campaigns are accurate, compliant, and aligned to best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help implement testing plans, learning how to measure impact and report results clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and quality check work delivered by Global Operations Centre (GOC) teams, escalating issues where required to maintain delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation of client performance reports and dashboards, ensuring data accuracy and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with performance analysis, identifying trends, anomalies, and opportunities to flag to clients and the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain internal trackers and documentation to support smooth delivery and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Team Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with Search and wider channel teams to support client deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend internal and client meetings where appropriate, building confidence in how search performance is discussed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established processes and ways of working to minimise risk and ensure high standards of delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support financial and operational hygiene by ensuring activity is accurately reflected in internal systems where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively engage in training, certifications, and coaching to build paid search knowledge and capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek feedback regularly and demonstrate progress against development goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team knowledge sharing by capturing learnings from tests, campaigns, or training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. In this role, it will be important to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by leading collectively to inspire transformational creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt; by balancing people and client experiences through trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by championing growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in paid search and digital marketing, with a desire to build a career in Search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on experience or exposure to Google Ads, Microsoft Ads, or paid media platforms (through research, work, placements, or training).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a willingness to learn technical and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of confidence working with numbers and data, with curiosity about what performance trends mean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and a collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, organised approach to managing tasks and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
