&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;That mission comes to life through our people. Behind every innovation, customer success, and milestone are talented people working together to make a difference. &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;That&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;looking for people who are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;bold enough to think big, authentic in how they lead and collaborate, curious about&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;what&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW130164568 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible, and committed to delivering results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
